{"id":"n81313-1-7","stage":5,"title":"통째 · 整个","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81313-1-7-1","ko":"오이랑 당근은 어떻게 할까?","zh":"黄瓜和胡萝卜怎么处理？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오이랑","meaning":"黄瓜","explanation":"오이：黄瓜；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"오이","audio":"/audio/3ba1c580e4879ae2e56e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68059","senseId":"1","lemma":"오이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오이랑","audio":"/audio/579965d455823019018b.mp3"}},{"text":"당근은","meaning":"胡萝卜","explanation":"당근：胡萝卜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"당근","audio":"/audio/5fd79be79a846cb1247a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49463","senseId":"1","lemma":"당근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당근은","audio":"/audio/ac757a3b2c32b4fa5acd.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"할까?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까","audio":"/audio/8f972208798a5637049f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3ba1c580e4879ae2","term":"오이","zh":"黄瓜","audio":"/audio/3ba1c580e4879ae2e56e.mp3","entryId":"68059","definition":"夏天开黄花，结草绿色的长条椭圆形果实的植物；或指该果实。","pronunciation":["오이"]},{"id":"5fd79be79a846cb1","term":"당근","zh":"胡萝卜","audio":"/audio/5fd79be79a846cb1247a.mp3","entryId":"49463","definition":"呈红色长角状，味甜，根可供食用的蔬菜。","pronunciation":["당근"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e02eeeebacc38612532.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81313-1-7-2","ko":"통째로 껍질만 깨끗이 씻어서 물기를 빼놓으면 돼.","zh":"不用切，把外皮洗干净，再沥去水分就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"통째로","meaning":"整个，全部","explanation":"통째：整个，全部；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"통째","audio":"/audio/2f94b5bfbe0307be3df4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81313","senseId":"1","lemma":"통째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통째로","audio":"/audio/f1b984d428e0514c3972.mp3"}},{"text":"껍질만","meaning":"壳","explanation":"껍질：壳；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"껍질","audio":"/audio/d7751cf145cf30006a71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39556","senseId":"1","lemma":"껍질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"껍질만","audio":"/audio/fa725f86fdf3e8ee6f7a.mp3"}},{"text":"깨끗이","meaning":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","explanation":"깨끗이：完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","readings":[{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61076","senseId":"5","lemma":"깨끗이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}},{"text":"씻어서","meaning":"洗，刷","explanation":"씻다：洗，刷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"씻다","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17191","senseId":"1","lemma":"씻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씻어서","audio":"/audio/527b9c0a43e0ee9a093a.mp3"}},{"text":"물기를","meaning":"潮气，水分","explanation":"물기：潮气，水分；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물기","audio":"/audio/0e2d8d28de0f93d8737d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15419","senseId":"1","lemma":"물기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물기를","audio":"/audio/11bac03aba44148e4aaa.mp3"}},{"text":"빼놓으면","meaning":"放，排，泄；表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"빼다：放，排，泄；놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"},{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"6","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼놓으면","audio":"/audio/1c3a12009fa5ab637afa.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f94b5bfbe0307be","term":"통째","zh":"整个，全部","audio":"/audio/2f94b5bfbe0307be3df4.mp3","entryId":"81313","definition":"没被分开的一个整体。","pronunciation":["통째"]},{"id":"d7751cf145cf3000","term":"껍질","zh":"壳","audio":"/audio/d7751cf145cf30006a71.mp3","entryId":"39556","definition":"包围着物体外部的坚硬的部分。","pronunciation":["껍찔"]},{"id":"356f24a2b3817821","term":"깨끗이","zh":"完全地，彻底地，干净利落地","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3","entryId":"61076","definition":"毫无留痕地。","pronunciation":["깨끄시"]},{"id":"1fc19ed194af1338","term":"씻다","zh":"洗，刷","audio":"/audio/1fc19ed194af13383940.mp3","entryId":"17191","definition":"除去污垢或脏的东西而使之干净。","pronunciation":["씯따"]},{"id":"0e2d8d28de0f93d8","term":"물기","zh":"潮气，水分","audio":"/audio/0e2d8d28de0f93d8737d.mp3","entryId":"15419","definition":"湿润的水气。","pronunciation":["물끼"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"放，排，泄","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"将某场所内的空气、水或气体等向外导出。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/25209882e586ed9b7958.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.302,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81313","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不用切，把外皮洗干净，再沥去水分就行。","这里作为墓地怎么样？","黄瓜和胡萝卜怎么处理？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不用切，把外皮洗干净，再沥去水分就行。","黄瓜和胡萝卜怎么处理？","这里作为墓地怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
